WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.440
Samaria, in the 9th century BCE.

2
00:00:03.490 --> 00:00:06.980
Two kings sit at the city
gate, planning a war.

3
00:00:07.030 --> 00:00:11.740
About 400 prophets give the
same answer: go up and attack.

4
00:00:11.790 --> 00:00:14.760
One more prophet, Micaiah, is sent for.

5
00:00:14.810 --> 00:00:16.830
The king says he hates him.

6
00:00:16.880 --> 00:00:20.020
Every one of them speaks in
the name of the same God.

7
00:00:20.070 --> 00:00:23.180
So who was right, and
how could anyone tell?

8
00:00:23.230 --> 00:00:27.600
In this mission, you'll test the
Bible's own criteria for a true prophet,

9
00:00:27.650 --> 00:00:29.450
one card at a time.

10
00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:33.970
Then you'll watch a herdsman called Amos
refuse to leave a royal sanctuary at

11
00:00:34.020 --> 00:00:35.040
Bethel.

12
00:00:35.090 --> 00:00:39.710
Your mission: find out how anyone could
tell a true prophet from a false one.
